{"id": "EUVD-2026-97008", "enisaUuid": "7670edb0-fcb9-3ec2-a6ed-513ee05e143c", "description": "Hugging Face Text Embeddings Inference through 1.9.4 contains a cleartext logging vulnerability that exposes the configured api_key because the router's Args struct lacks a redact attribute for it. Attackers with access to router logs, container output, or OTLP telemetry can recover the Bearer token and call the protected embedding and rerank endpoints.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T13:26:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:59:39", "baseScore": 4.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/huggingface-text-embeddings-inference-api-key-startup-log", "https://github.com/huggingface/text-embeddings-inference/blob/e80ef225ed0e6cb1717ce632a6a84b6cf211bb67/router/src/main.rs#L170-L174", "https://github.com/huggingface/text-embeddings-inference/blob/e80ef225ed0e6cb1717ce632a6a84b6cf211bb67/router/src/main.rs#L204-L216", "https://github.com/huggingface/text-embeddings-inference", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/hugging-face-text-embeddings-inference-through-1.9.4-cleartext-api-key-logging"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108857", "GHSA-6w4q-53gw-556h"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "af0cd37b-b61f-338b-8a23-d971add5e916", "product": {"name": "Text Embeddings Inference", "vendor": {"name": "Hugging Face"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.9.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "52e0f59e-da54-380f-81d8-a3974634b9d6", "vendor": {"name": "Hugging Face"}}], "isExploited": false}